Z||000000||CoolBlue87GT||08-06-2001||12:05 PM||||*** updated ***<P>Here's my 147 pic's - Hot off the press !!  Here's one that I'll never forget !!<P>To save loading time,  Click of the following address for the photo's<BR> <BR><A HREF="http://www.ofoto.com/I.jsp?m=31463468103&n=1940447256" TARGET=_blank>http://www.ofoto.com/I.jsp?m=31463468103&n=1940447256</A> <P>or try<P><A HREF="http://communities.msn.com/SuncoastFieroClub/williamsburg2001fieroshow.msnw?Page=1" TARGET=_blank>http://communities.msn.com/SuncoastFieroClub/williamsburg2001fieroshow.msnw?Page=1</A><p>[This message has been edited by CoolBlue87GT (edited 08-08-2001).]||||reg||4
Z||000001||fierobaby||08-06-2001||12:36 PM||||GREAT PICS! :-) thanks for putting the work into putting them up! I didn't get to go but I can live through these pictures... I'm woundering whats with the pig head though...<P>and<P> <IMG SRC="http://images.ofoto.com/photos127/1/68/73/35/45/0/45357368103_0_ALB.jpg">  who is this guy?<p>[This message has been edited by fierobaby (edited 08-06-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||JohnF||08-06-2001||12:45 PM||||Great pix!  All 147 loaded almost instantly.<BR>Thanx.<P> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1578096&a=12001112&p=52558251&Sequence=0"> ||||reg||12
Z||000003||CoolBlue87GT||08-06-2001||12:53 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by fierobaby:<BR><B>GREAT PICS! :-) ... I'm woundering whats with the pig head though...</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>There a possible joke that could be made here, but I'll leave that for some one else !<P>They gave Phil a special award.  I can't remember what it was, maybe someone else can add what it was for.<P>All in all, the night was fun, many special people were recognized for their help, the J.D. Hobbs family for one.<P>Everyone had fun, at that was the whole point, to enjoy everyone's stories and cars.<P>I learned alot from many people. One thing, there is a filter that all most everybody's car was missing. It is for the cruise control. It's located above the Vac reservar, and was a grey foam thing.  Looks like a mic windscreen.<p>[This message has been edited by CoolBlue87GT (edited 08-06-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000004||LZeitgeist||08-06-2001||01:03 PM||||Wow!! Great pics!! Thanks for putting those up for us to see...<P>I'm kinda embarrassed, 'cuz it doesn't look like I acknowledged a camera all weekend... I keep seeing pics of me in my car but I'm looking straight ahead... heck, I didn't even know people were takin' pics of me! LOL!||||reg||1
Z||000005||FIERO JOHN-WI||08-06-2001||01:21 PM||||Great pictures, infact by looking at all the pictures I felt like I was there!||||reg||1
Z||000006||CoolBlue87GT||08-06-2001||01:37 PM||||    <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by LZeitgeist:<BR><B>Wow!! Great pics!! Thanks for putting those up for us to see...<BR>LOL!</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I'll edit out some later, it was faster to load them all, than one by one.<P>There are some shots of a log cabin, three of us stayed in for one night while on the way.  It was so funny, there weren't any sheets and between the three of us taking turns snoring none of us had a full nights rest. - Well, maybe Ron did, as he kept snoring most night.<P>It reminded me of summer camp when I was 8 ! Even the bathroom & showers were in another building 30 feet away.<P>It was 'rustic' to say the least, but it was fun for one night - ONLY one night ! LOL<P>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Dsc00017_1.jpg">    <BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Dsc00018.jpg">    <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Dsc00019_1.jpg"> <BR><p>[This message has been edited by CoolBlue87GT (edited 08-06-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000007||Formula88||08-06-2001||03:25 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by CoolBlue87GT:<BR><B>  They gave Phil a special award.  I can't remember what it was, maybe someone else can add what it was for.<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>It was an appreciation award for all the hard work and effor Phil has put into the shows.  Given his affinity for "strange" and "unusual" items, and since they didn't have a trophey, etc. to give him, the pig's head from the dinner buffet was chosen as the appropriate gift.  And yes, Phil even had a story to go with that!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>The man's shared so many Fiero experiences, he could tell a story for virtually each and every trophy awarded.  They all reminded him of something.  Amazing!<P>I've said it before on another post, but I'll say it again here...Thank you Phil for all the hard work you put into making this festival as good as it was.  <BR>||||reg||6
Z||000008||CoolBlue87GT||08-06-2001||03:50 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Formula88:<BR><B>Thank you Phil for all the hard work you put into making this festival as good as it was.  </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Ah yes, I'll 2nd that. Thank you Phil and Gloria for all the back round things you've done to make this possible.<P>Dave<P>||||reg||6
